SUMMARY:***TIME UPDATE ***Drinks and Darts
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\n***TIME UPDATE*** 
 Time of event changed to 5:30 pm !Let’s meet at Buffalo Billiards for a 
 casual game of darts . They also have pool\, Pac-Man \, air hockey and oth
 er games .\n\nIf less than 8 people RSVP by the day of the event I will ca
 ncel. I am also cross posting this event with Marin Millennials .
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/315980450/
