CREATED:20260804T225249Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260804T225249Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_315798397@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260807T032507Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260811T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260811T203000
SUMMARY:Trivia at Trailhead (Novato) 
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\n🎉 Join Us for T
 rivia Night! 🧠☕️\nThis event is cross-posted with Sonoma Marin Brat
  Pack\, Marin County Millennials\, and North Bay 20s30s Meetup\, so RSVPs 
 may not reflect the full crowd.\n\nWe’re Team Quizzards! I’ll be at mo
 st events\, and if I can’t make it\, you’ll still find some friendly r
 egulars there. Look for us at the back of the coffee shop — come say hi 
 and join the fun! 🎉\n\n🕡 Trivia kicks off promptly at 6:30 PM\, so s
 wing by a bit earlier if you'd like to grab a drink or something tasty to 
 eat before we get started. I plan to be there at 6 pm to try to get us a g
 ood table .\n📍 Location:\nTrailhead Coffee\n127 San Marin Drive\, Novat
 o\, CA\nBring your friends\, your appetite\, and your A-game — see you t
 here! 🙌
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/315798397/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260723T013003Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260723T013003Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_315878742@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260807T032507Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260814T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260814T194500
SUMMARY:Afterwork nature walk at shollenberger park
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nUnwind from your w
 orkweek with a serene and picturesque afternoon hike at Shollenberger Park
  in Petaluma! Join us for an evening of relaxation\, beautiful views\, and
  great company as we explore the scenic trails of this beloved local park.
 \n\nin the afternoon sun\, we'll stroll along the tranquil pathways of Sho
 llenberger Park\, enjoying the vibrant colors of the sky and the peaceful 
 ambiance of the surrounding wetlands. This easy\, flat hike is perfect for
  all skill levels and provides a wonderful opportunity to connect with nat
 ure and de-stress.\n\nWe will meet at the parking lot off of McDowell Blvd
  and begin our walk. it should be a relatively short walk and we will like
 ly go grab a bite to eat after.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/315878742/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260728T193012Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T193012Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
